### 3. Add a staging-only drill control API

Do not reuse or weaken tenant authentication. Add a separate router included only when all of these are true:

- hosted Fly Sprites mode;
- `MANAGED_RECOVERY_DRILL_ENABLED=true`;
- public launch is false;
- an operator-token hash is configured;
- the deployment is explicitly marked staging.

