### 5. Controlled fault and restart hooks

Add staging-only fault points for:

- lost multipart completion response;
- candidate created before catalog publication;
- guest result published before activation;
- activation committed before final completion.

Faults must be:

- selected by an allow-listed enum;
- scoped to one drill ID;
- persisted so restart behavior is deterministic;
- impossible to enable unless drill mode is enabled;
- automatically cleared during cleanup.

